1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,039
Father.

17
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,180
Yes?

18
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:50,880
Jingchen.

19
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:53,240
You're a commander now.

20
00:00:53,399 --> 00:00:54,920
Sit down and eat with us.

21
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,880
I owe my position to you, Governor.

22
00:00:57,479 --> 00:00:59,960
It's my duty to serve you.

23
00:01:03,719 --> 00:01:04,959
What's with that look?

24
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,480
I'm telling you,

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,560
from now on,

26
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:09,840
show Jingchen some respect.

27
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:10,920
Jingchen.

28
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,680
Have a seat.

29
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:12,799
All right.

30
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,599
I know, Father.

31
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:20,760
Yanyan.

32
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:22,280
Your favorite.

33
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,400
Commander He.

34
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:32,359
You're Father's most valued man now.

35
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,400
We can't have you going without.

36
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,439
Ms. Lu,

37
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:40,840
you should worry about yourself.

38
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,000
I don't need to.

39
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,719
Governor.

40
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:47,120
I don't have much of an appetite.

41
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,120
I'll go back to my room.

42
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:57,120
=Episode 12=

43
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,319
Move.

44
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,759
I see it now.

45
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,439
Jingchen doesn't even like her.

46
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,199
She's the one clinging to him.

47
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,599
And now,

48
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,560
because she helped us,

49
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,319
she's gotten even more brazen.

50
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:20,400
Didn't you see her at dinner?

51
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,400
She looked so smug.

52
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,360
Jingchen.

53
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,360
Take a look.

54
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:35,960
Rong Yunhai, the opium king,

55
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,120
has been corresponding with me

56
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,400
about opening opium dens in Fancheng.

57
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,840
He's always been noncommittal.

58
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,680
But now,

59
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:46,240
he's finally sent his youngest son,
Rong Muxian,

60
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,680
to inspect Fancheng.

61
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,000
From what I know,

62
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,439
he thinks very highly of his youngest.

63
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,960
If we can win him over,

64
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:57,039
the deal is practically ours.

65
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,840
You plan to buy opium from Rong Yunhai?

66
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,039
In the first year,

67
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:05,560
we'll open 20 dens,

68
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:07,439
including in nearby counties.

69
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,800
Once business takes off,

70
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,680
I'll open casinos and brothels too.

71
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,800
They'll all feed into each other.

72
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,439
Every one of them will make money.

73
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:17,599
But that's for later.

74
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:19,520
Right now, our priority

75
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,680
is winning the young man over.

76
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,919
I'm putting you in charge.

77
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,319
Yes, Governor.

78
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,120
Shopkeeper.

79
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,759
Steamed lamb with rice flour to go.

80
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,439
Coming right up.

81
00:03:30,439 --> 00:03:31,960
Steamed lamb with rice flour to go!

82
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:35,199
You're a pretty little thing.

83
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,159
Come have a drink.

84
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,479
Have one with me.

85
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,240
I don't drink.

86
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,479
Please let me go.

87
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,000
Then I'll teach you.

88
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,560
You can learn.

89
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:46,639
What do you think you're doing?

90
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,400
Let her go.

91
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,080
Harassing civilians in broad daylight?

92
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,560
Do you deserve to wear those uniforms?

93
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,639
Who are you?

94
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,840
You see these uniforms
and still dare interfere?

95
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,719
You've got guts.

96
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:56,879
She can go.

97
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:58,840
You drink with me instead.

98
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:00,400
Let go of me!

99
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:00,960
Let go!

100
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:03,080
Let go!

101
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,280
Come on. Have a drink.

102
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,039
Ms. Lu!

103
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,159
Commander Yang, don't!

104
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,000
She's Ms. Lu!

105
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,919
It's Ms. Lu!

106
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:08,800
Ms. Lu?

107
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:10,960
Ms. Lu who?

108
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,199
You...

109
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:15,159
You work for Lady Feng
at the Governor's Residence.

110
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,759
Who did you just say she was?

111
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,720
She's Ms. Lu.

112
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:19,319
She's the governor's long-lost daughter.
He only just found her.

113
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:22,879
This...

114
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:24,120
We didn't recognize our own kin.

115
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,360
We're family, after all.

116
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,040
Just a misunderstanding.

117
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,360
Commander Yang is right.

118
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,600
Outside the army,

119
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,120
the governor is our distant uncle.

120
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:33,720
So that makes you our little cousin.

121
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,639
Exactly.

122
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:35,480
Have you eaten?

123
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:36,879
Come on.

124
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,480
Sit down and have something.

125
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,040
Come on.

126
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,560
Who says we're family?

127
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,879
Enjoy your meal.

128
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,120
Cousin!

129
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,240
Your cousin's buying!

130
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,240
Our treat!

131
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,120
Don't go!

132
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:46,680
You...

133
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,279
They're really commanders?

134
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:51,040
Those two jerks are commanders?

135
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,800
I wouldn't dare judge them,

136
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,240
but as for family ties,

137
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:58,040
they really are the governor's
distant nephews.

138
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,839
So it's pure nepotism.

139
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,240
The Lu Army really is corrupt.

140
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,720
By the way,

141
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:05,279
how did you know I was here?

142
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:09,120
I heard you were getting steamed lamb
with rice flour for the governor.

143
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,480
So I followed you.

144
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:13,639
Some things are easier to say outside.

145
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:16,360
Does Lady Feng have
something else on me?

146
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:18,560
No.

147
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,839
I want to work for you.

148
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,120
Please take me in, Ms. Lu.

149
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,480
Lady Feng keeps targeting you.

150
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:29,160
I can help you get rid of her.

151
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,720
Sure.

152
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:34,920
All right.

153
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,399
It's you?

154
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,319
Where's Yanyan?

155
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,600
Go tell her.

156
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,959
I had a friend bring these
from Gangcheng.

157
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,600
Only expectant parents

158
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,519
would be interested in these.

159
00:05:52,399 --> 00:05:53,959
Lady Feng isn't one,

160
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,839
so she can't understand how you feel.

161
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,160
What do you mean?

162
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,519
(I never wanted to get rid of anyone.)

163
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:07,480
(You helped me just now,)

164
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:09,399
(so I'll pretend you never said that.)

165
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,800
(Ms. Lu doesn't want to protect me.)

166
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:17,480
(I'll have to find someone who will.)

167
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,480
What I mean is,

168
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,480
Lady Feng isn't pregnant.

169
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,680
Governor,

170
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:27,120
she lied to you.

171
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:32,040
Do you know what you're saying?

172
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,920
Say that again!

173
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:38,279
Lady Feng isn't pregnant.

174
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,879
Governor, she lied to you.

175
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:44,040
Governor, please calm down.

176
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:44,959
Please calm down.

177
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,879
You still have me.

178
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,480
You...

179
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,399
What are you doing?

180
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,079
Let go of me!

181
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:32,160
I'm pregnant!

182
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,160
Commander He.

183
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,199
The governor wants to see you.

184
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,639
Understood.

185
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,240
Governor.

186
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,279
Governor.

187
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,160
You sent for me?

188
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,079
Go.

189
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,399
Have Dr. Liang arrested.

190
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,839
Yes, Governor.

191
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,439
Have him shot.

192
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:07,720
Yes.

193
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,839
Get some men.

194
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,480
Get Dr. Liang out of the barracks.

195
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,319
Hurry.

196
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:21,680
Yes.

197
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,839
What about you?

198
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,480
I have to go too.

199
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,240
I have to keep up appearances.

200
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:30,519
Send two more men

201
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,439
to find out

202
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,279
what exactly happened with Que'er

203
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:35,919
and where Feng Yanyan is now.

204
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:36,840
Yes.

205
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,200
Yutang.

206
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,720
Meet your Fourteenth Concubine.

207
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:46,320
Ms. Lu may need time
to get used to calling me that.

208
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,720
Governor,
don't make things difficult for her.

209
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,320
Of course not.

210
00:08:52,799 --> 00:08:53,639
Father,

211
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,279
you have someone new
who understands you.

212
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,360
I'm happy for you.

213
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,559
Here.

214
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,320
Lady Que, have some tea.

215
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,000
Governor.

216
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,480
When Commander He reached the barracks,

217
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,559
Dr. Liang was already gone.

218
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,960
Then find him!

219
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,399
Yes.

220
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,759
Don't worry.

221
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:24,679
Just because Iron Leopard
slept with Feng Yanyan's maid

222
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:26,639
doesn't mean Feng Yanyan is in danger.

223
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,200
Did you find out?

224
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,080
Lady Feng's fake pregnancy was exposed.

225
00:09:35,519 --> 00:09:37,120
The governor locked her
in the back courtyard.

226
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,320
How was she exposed?

227
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,480
That maid of hers,
Que'er, was behind it.

228
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,639
All right. I understand.

229
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,360
You may go.

230
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,600
Keep men watching the back courtyard.

231
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,840
Tell me immediately if anything happens.

232
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,279
Yes.

233
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:51,840
We need to get Feng Yanyan
out of the Governor's Residence.

234
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,639
Look at you.

235
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,440
You lose your head
whenever she's involved.

236
00:09:58,519 --> 00:10:01,639
You covered for her plan
to fake an accidental miscarriage.

237
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,240
She wouldn't cooperate.

238
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:06,440
Then she even brought in two girls
to expose Su Yutang's identity,

239
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,080
leaving you in a terrible spot.

240
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,200
If you ask me,

241
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,600
she'll bite the hand that feeds her.

242
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,720
Those two girls died because of her too.

243
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,279
Iron Leopard has killed so many people.

244
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,639
That's why we need to get her out fast.

245
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,720
Given the current situation,

246
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,360
she can't stay at
the Governor's Residence any longer.

247
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:26,720
I can't just stand by and watch her
become the twelfth memorial tablet.

248
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,200
You only just

249
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,399
escaped Iron Leopard's suspicion,

250
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,440
and now you've been promoted.

251
00:10:31,639 --> 00:10:32,639
You're too conspicuous now.

252
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,960
You can't act rashly.

253
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,279
Besides,

254
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,840
what matters most right now?

255
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,600
Preparing for
Young Master Rong's arrival.

256
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:41,159
I understand all that.

257
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:43,200
But Feng Yanyan is still...

258
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,799
I know she saved you.

259
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:46,559
I never said we wouldn't protect her.

260
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:50,679
Here's what we'll do.

261
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:54,159
We'll leave this to Su Yutang.

262
00:10:54,559 --> 00:10:55,759
She's full of tricks.

263
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,000
She'll find a way.

264
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:58,919
Don't worry.

265
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:23,040
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

266
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:27,680
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

267
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:30,840
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

268
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,360
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

269
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:37,720
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

270
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:43,680
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

271
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,400
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

272
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,880
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

273
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,200
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

274
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:57,440
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

275
00:11:57,920 --> 00:12:04,120
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

276
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:07,720
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

277
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:10,920
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

278
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:17,440
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

279
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,840
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

280
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:24,160
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

281
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:27,000
♪Boundless♪
